     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>The permutation of <i>n</i> objects taken <i>r</i> at a time is <span data-math=\"{\\rm{nPr}} = \\frac{{n!}}{{(n - r)!}}\"></span>where 1 ≤ <i>r</i> ≤ <i>n</i>.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"{\\rm{12P3}} = \\frac{{n!}}{{\\left( {n - r} \\right)!}} = \\frac{{12!}}{{\\left( {12 - 3} \\right)!}} = \\frac{{12!}}{{9!}} = \\frac{{12 \\times 11 \\times 10 \\times \\cancel{{9!}}}}{{\\cancel{{9!}}}} = 1,320\"></span></p>\n"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "1,320"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  }
 ],
